{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From one of the artists behind &quot;Deponia&quot;, &quot;Leisure Suit Larry&quot; and a bunch of game you never heard of, comes a new experience:</i><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Is THIS a game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it has everything you'd expect from a video game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >loads of buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pixels (more than 1000!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >even animation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >achievements (those are important, right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mouse-cursor to point and even click sometimes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >state of the art 8 bit sound-design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An axolotl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 mini-\u201dgames\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop culture references to ALL your (aka my) favorite game franchises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u2026 is this enough? What even is a game? Does this count? How much interactivity do you need? Are games art? What am I and if yes\u2026 how many? Are there maybe TOO many axolotls in this game?<br><br>Come in and find out for only 4 bucks! Only for a limited time (&lt;= lie)! Support a more or less struggling gameartist, working in the industry for 10+ years (and still not good enough for the artstation front page). Aaaanyway, thank you for your time and have fun \u201cplaying\u201d this \u201cgame\u201d...<br><br>Jo out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wooooow!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/039eab3c9c8bc80bb47a88c0e12cb4466f41fc40.jpg"},{"name":"Nah!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/9bcc974ad9dae08bdef03aa4e1d1bb3940ed4ed7.jpg"},{"name":"Just give up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/51300da8924b94803ca000c79863f7278d8afe09.jpg"},{"name":"Waste of time...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/3634e1d41fb35dde229e802308c24782583de398.jpg"},{"name":"SPACE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/ed5d4890169233fa0a53ad88891d63381e2e1ab3.jpg"},{"name":"pro gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/27232b8dff67f7742f76b88f353233ee1ee2c952.jpg"},{"name":"Boooooooring!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/8a03b3f56f47170646ceac6eeeb5f0e7c0941a02.jpg"},{"name":"Earned it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/6e3fa779125226cc5449fcfacb692064a2f2c36e.jpg"},{"name":"Just take it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/d60cce28dc74ed10939724c7acc0a6e59269a528.jpg"},{"name":"The sandwich is a lie!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691100/886faa134759219e81e8eda0c721d118e74e12fa.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691100?t=1750014717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/83486fbbb957f36c331669a7d30ef8249eea6b9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750014717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/b800facaee680ea7bd88de6398e90f4087ba57b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750014717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/b800facaee680ea7bd88de6398e90f4087ba57b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750014717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From one of the artists behind &quot;Deponia&quot;, &quot;Leisure Suit Larry&quot; and a bunch of game you never heard of, comes a new experience:</i><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Is THIS a game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it has everything you'd expect from a video game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >loads of buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pixels (more than 1000!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >even animation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >achievements (those are important, right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mouse-cursor to point and even click sometimes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >state of the art 8 bit sound-design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An axolotl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 mini-\u201dgames\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pop culture references to ALL your (aka my) favorite game franchises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u2026 is this enough? What even is a game? Does this count? How much interactivity do you need? Are games art? What am I and if yes\u2026 how many? Are there maybe TOO many axolotls in this game?<br><br>Come in and find out for only 4 bucks! Only for a limited time (&lt;= lie)! Support a more or less struggling gameartist, working in the industry for 10+ years (and still not good enough for the artstation front page). Aaaanyway, thank you for your time and have fun \u201cplaying\u201d this \u201cgame\u201d...<br><br>Jo out.</p>","developers":["Johannes Lott"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/aba47c1db0f1427b85a7e1abfe65ecbae23e4cd2/header.jpg?t=1750014717","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Johannes Lott 2025","linux_re